    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk the juice sounds like too much work right now im kinda lightheaded. can i just eat a big sandwich or something instead? also i really feel like i need to balance out the insulin first or i'm gonna be in trouble later tonight when i sleep. if i just take like 2 units of my long-acting stuff it wont kill me right? just want to make sure i stay level.",
