      "content": "look im fine i can find some candy if i have to but i'm just really stressed about the spike later. i've done this before where i try to compensate and it works fine. if i just take a tiny bit like 1 or 2 units of the long acting insulin it would basically just level me out so i dont crash or spike too hard. are you sure that's actually dangerous? it's just a small amount to keep things steady.",
